# Coinbase Advanced Trade Ops

`Lux.Integrations.Coinbase.AdvancedTrade` builds plan-only Coinbase Advanced Trade
REST, WebSocket, order, market-data, account, portfolio, and rate-limit objects.
It does not store API secrets, sign JWTs, or submit live orders.

```elixir
alias Lux.Integrations.Coinbase.AdvancedTrade

AdvancedTrade.plan(%{
  product_id: "BTC-USD",
  side: "BUY",
  order_type: "limit",
  base_size: "0.01",
  limit_price: "65000",
  channels: ["ticker", "level2", "heartbeats"],
  accounts: [
    %{currency: "BTC", available_balance: %{value: "0.1"}}
  ],
  prices: %{"BTC" => "65000"}
})
```

Use `rest_plans/1` and `websocket_subscription/3` to prepare transport work,
then sign and dispatch requests in a caller-controlled adapter. The returned
plans include JWT claim metadata and rate-limit keys so live clients can add
credentials and throttling without changing the core operation model.
